{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Move to Start the Fight! Experience the pure excitement of this easy-to-learn roguelite survival game in <i>Chaos Hero Demo</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an intense survival challenge where you only need to move your character. Dodge through hordes of monsters and bullet hell, collect experience to level up, and choose your growth path from random enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a desperate survivor and, through continuous choices, evolve into an unstoppable hero capable of tearing through thousands of enemies. Every attempt makes you stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the chaos today \u2013 try the free demo and begin your legend</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091740?t=1760356725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091740/ef8a1ec7ac26fb557b9cc0c17321fa57d1c07bb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760356725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091740/317d1a5b29854b31b9014eca02c95c4a1e602794/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760356725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091740/317d1a5b29854b31b9014eca02c95c4a1e602794/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760356725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Move to Start the Fight! Experience the pure excitement of this easy-to-learn roguelite survival game in <i>Chaos Hero Demo</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an intense survival challenge where you only need to move your character. Dodge through hordes of monsters and bullet hell, collect experience to level up, and choose your growth path from random enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a desperate survivor and, through continuo